    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d66-a1-a1-a9">

                <pb facs="0452" n="238" xml:id="pg238"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Consulate</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Panama,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1871-05-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 30, 1871.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I, Owen M. Long, consul of the United States in and for Panama, that the above
                    affidavit or statement of facts by Captain Saunders is a true and correct of the
                    original, as recorded in my book of miscellaneous records, on pages 19, 20, 21,
                    and 22.</p>
                <p>In testimony whereof I have hereunto set my hand and affixed the seal of the
                    consulate at Panama, day and date above written.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>.] OWEN M. LONG, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
